    "detailed_description": "RunetLegend is a visual novel dedicated to the first game reviewer in Russia.<br><br>Arnold Schwarzenegger? Jean-Claude Van Damme? Sylvester Stallone? No! This game is dedicated to a real legend who began his journey back in 2006. We are talking about the blogger Ozon671Games. This game completely conveys the deep inner world of our main character.Ozon671Games is not just a blogger, but a true icon of the world of YouTube! His fascinating streams, exciting adventures and charming charisma have made him a favorite of millions. Now in the new game you can plunge into his amazing world, where every step is filled with incredible events and exciting quests.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978970/extras/9d158ca6b7763f6274d8d708b028a773.avif?t=1737416090\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>The game offers you the opportunity to become a part of the incredible adventures of Ozon671Games, explore his world, help him solve problems and face dangers together. You will be able to learn his story, his dreams and fears, immerse yourself in the world of his successes and trials.<br><br>After Ozon671Games drank beer on the stream, he suddenly moved back in time and found himself in 2013. The reason for the shock was that he is now the most popular blogger on the Runet. But meeting Mendelssohn, his long-time rival on YouTube, added even more contradictory emotions to him. Mendelssohn begs Ozone to give it all back.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978970/extras/95e071b7f0d841d47868ce259e4f2f46.avif?t=1737416090\" width=600 height=220 /></span><br><br>Will our hero give up popularity? Will she be able to forgive Mendelssohn for all his words from the past? Will he be able to cope with the sudden popularity? All these questions can be answered by playing this amazing game.<br><br>To move further along the plot, you need to complete quests, look for various items that will help you get closer to the finale. Exciting adventures, secrets of the past and difficult decisions are waiting for you. Control the fate of Ozon671Games and help him figure out this difficult situation.",
